@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 250

title Création d'un post et mise à jour des statistiques en temps réel

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "PostCreateComponent\n(Frontend)" as PostCreateComp
participant "PostService\n(Frontend)" as PostServiceFront
participant "PostController\n(Backend)" as PostController
participant "PostService\n(Backend)" as PostService
participant "AuthService\n(Backend)" as AuthService
participant "TopicRepository\n(Backend)" as TopicRepo
participant "PostRepository\n(Backend)" as PostRepo
participant "TopicStatsEmitter\n(Backend)" as TopicStatsEmitter
participant "SseController\n(Backend)" as SseController
participant "Base de données\n(PostgreSQL/R2DBC)" as DB
participant "TopicStatsService\n(Frontend)" as TopicStatsService
actor "Autres Utilisateurs" as OtherUsers

== Initialisation de la connexion SSE ==

User -> TopicStatsService: Chargement de l'application
activate TopicStatsService
TopicStatsService -> SseController: Connexion au flux SSE\n(GET /api/topics/stats/stream)
activate SseController
SseController -> TopicStatsEmitter: getTopicStatsStream()
activate TopicStatsEmitter
TopicStatsEmitter --> SseController: Flux<ServerSentEvent>
SseController --> TopicStatsService: Connexion SSE établie
note right of TopicStatsService: La connexion SSE reste ouverte\npour recevoir les mises à jour

== Création d'un nouveau post ==

User -> PostCreateComp: Remplit le formulaire et clique sur "Créer"
activate PostCreateComp
PostCreateComp -> PostCreateComp: Validation du formulaire
PostCreateComp -> PostServiceFront: createPost(newPost: PostDto)
activate PostServiceFront
PostServiceFront -> PostController: HTTP POST /api/posts
activate PostController
PostController -> PostService: createPost(postDto)
activate PostService

PostService -> AuthService: getAuthenticatedUserId()
activate AuthService
AuthService --> PostService: userId
deactivate AuthService

PostService -> PostService: postMapper.postDtoToPost(postDto)
PostService -> TopicRepo: findById(postDto.getTopicId())
activate TopicRepo
TopicRepo -> DB: Requête R2DBC (non-bloquante)
activate DB
DB --> TopicRepo: Topic
deactivate DB
TopicRepo --> PostService: Mono<Topic>
deactivate TopicRepo

PostService -> PostRepo: save(post)
activate PostRepo
PostRepo -> DB: Requête SQL INSERT (non-bloquante)
activate DB
note right of DB: Opération asynchrone\nLe thread n'est pas bloqué
DB --> PostRepo: Résultat
deactivate DB
PostRepo --> PostService: Mono<Post>
deactivate PostRepo

PostService -> PostService: enrichPostDto(post)
note right of PostService: Ajoute des informations\nsupplémentaires au DTO

== Calcul et diffusion des statistiques ==

PostService -> PostService: getTopicStats()
activate PostService #DarkSalmon
PostService -> TopicRepo: findAll()
activate TopicRepo
TopicRepo -> DB: Requête R2DBC (non-bloquante)
activate DB
DB --> TopicRepo: Liste des topics
deactivate DB
TopicRepo --> PostService: Flux<Topic>
deactivate TopicRepo

loop Pour chaque topic
    PostService -> PostRepo: countByTopicId(topic.getId())
    activate PostRepo
    PostRepo -> DB: Requête COUNT (non-bloquante)
    activate DB
    DB --> PostRepo: Nombre de posts
    deactivate DB
    PostRepo --> PostService: Mono<Long>
    deactivate PostRepo

    PostService -> PostService: Calcul des statistiques
end
PostService -> PostService: Tri des topics par popularité
PostService -> PostService: collectList()
PostService -> TopicStatsEmitter: updateTopicStats(topicStats)
deactivate PostService #DarkSalmon

activate TopicStatsEmitter
TopicStatsEmitter -> TopicStatsEmitter: topicStatsSink.tryEmitNext(topicStats)
note right of TopicStatsEmitter: Émet les nouvelles statistiques\ndans le Sink réactif
TopicStatsEmitter --> SseController: Notification de nouvelles données
SseController -> SseController: Création d'un ServerSentEvent
SseController --> TopicStatsService: Envoi de l'événement "topic-stats-update"
TopicStatsService -> TopicStatsService: topicStatsSubject.next(stats)
deactivate TopicStatsEmitter

TopicStatsService --> User: Mise à jour de l'interface utilisateur
TopicStatsService --> OtherUsers: Mise à jour de l'interface pour tous les utilisateurs connectés

PostService --> PostController: PostDto enrichi
deactivate PostService
PostController --> PostServiceFront: Réponse HTTP 201 Created
deactivate PostController
PostServiceFront --> PostCreateComp: PostDto
deactivate PostServiceFront
PostCreateComp -> PostCreateComp: router.navigate(['/posts'])
PostCreateComp --> User: Redirection vers la liste des posts
deactivate PostCreateComp

@enduml
